---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import siteConfig from '../../../site.config.json';
---

<Layout
  title="About Pineapple OS"
  description="Our mission: building sovereign, lightweight, and resilient tech infrastructure for higher education in Cameroon and West/Central Africa."
  lang="en"
  alternateUrlFr="/fr/a-propos/"
  alternateUrlEn="/en/about/"
>
  <section class="py-16 bg-slate-900 text-white border-b border-slate-800 text-center">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4">About Pineapple OS</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-300 max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        Building sovereign, ultra-fast tech solutions tailored for African university campuses.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-20 bg-slate-50 text-slate-900">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 space-y-12">
      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">🇨🇲 Technology Designed for Africa</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Most university management software imported from Europe or North America is heavy, bandwith-hungry, and ill-suited for local constraints (unstable mobile internet, budget Android smartphones, decentralized lecture hall management).
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed">
          Pineapple OS was built from day one to address these precise challenges: extreme lightness, offline resilience, and seamless collaboration between academic offices and student delegates.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-2xl border border-slate-200 shadow-md">
        <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-4">✉️ Direct Contact & Campus Presentations</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Our team of academic advisors and software engineers based in Yaoundé and Douala travel to your campus for live presentations before board directors and academic staff.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-4">
          <a
            href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-slate-900 text-white hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all text-center"
          >
            ✉️ Email contact@pineapple.cm
          </a>
          <a
            href={`https://wa.me/${siteConfig.whatsappNumber}`}
            target="_blank"
            class="px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-emerald-600 text-white hover:bg-emerald-700 transition-all text-center"
          >
            💬 Chat with WhatsApp Advisor
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
